[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_WOODEN_STAFF_I]
Wooden Staff (Witchcraft)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_WOODEN_STAFF_I_desc]
Recently, a new game called “roulette” has been gaining popularity throughout Equestria. However, if you find yourself unfamiliar with the perplexing concept of “guns”, there’s no need to worry. Instead, why not give this cheap and worn-out wooden staff a try? Despite its weathered appearance and questionable enchantments, wielding it is like playing a game of magical roulette: you never know what spell you’ll get, but it’s always a wild and unpredictable ride.
§g“Level 1 (0/500 XP)”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_WOODEN_STAFF_I_short]
Wooden Staff

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_WOODEN_STAFF_I]
木制法杖 (巫术装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_WOODEN_STAFF_I_desc]
最近，一种名为“轮盘赌”的新游戏在小马利亚越来越受欢迎。然而，如果您发现自己不熟悉“枪支”这个令人困惑的概念，也不必担心。相反，为什么不尝试一下这种廉价而破烂的木棍呢？尽管它的外观饱经风霜，附魔能力值得怀疑，但使用它就像玩魔法轮盘赌：你永远不知道你会得到什么咒语，但这始终是一场狂野且不可预测的旅程。
§g“等级 1 (0/500 经验)”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_WOODEN_STAFF_I_short]
木制法杖
